OL,3,GNEWSALong delays after lorry fire
OL,4,Acauses M65 closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are major delays on the M65
OL,7,Feastbound after a lorry fire and
OL,8,F"significant spillage" forced part of
OL,9,Fthe motorway to close.
OL,11,FThe emergency services were called to a
OL,12,Freport of the HGV being alight at about
OL,13,F05:15 BST.
OL,15,FThe fire has been put out but the
OL,16,Feastbound carriageway is expected to
OL,17,Fremain closed for some time, between
OL,18,FWhitebirk in Blackburn at junction 6
OL,19,Fand Accrington at junction 7 in
OL,20,FLancashire.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
